    mix_blend_mode: Normal | Darken | Multiply | ColorBurn | Lighten | Screen | ColorDodge | Overlay | SoftLight | HardLight | Difference | Exclusion | Hue | Saturation | ColorKeyword | Luminosity | PlusLighter | std.css.Values.Inherit | std.css.Values.Initial | std.css.Values.Unset | std.css.Values.Revert | std.css.Values.RevertLayer
